<view class="page"><view class="privacy-hero"><text class="lock">▣</text><text class="title">你的记录，由你掌控</text><text class="subtitle">私人正文默认仅在本人账号中展示。</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在加载…</view><block wx:else><view class="card row"><view><text class="item-title">AI 内容发送许可</text><text class="subtitle">仅发送你确认的当前内容，可随时撤回。</text></view><switch checked="{{info.aiConsent}}" disabled="{{busy}}" color="#0869f7" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view><text class="item-title">导出我的数据</text><text class="subtitle">包含本人文本与 JSON 数据。</text></view><button class="secondary small" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="requestExport">申请导出</button></view><text wx:if="{{info.exportState}}" class="status">当前状态：{{info.exportState}}</text></view><view class="card"><text class="item-title">删除进度</text><text class="subtitle">{{info.deletionState?('当前状态：'+info.deletionState):'尚未提交账号清理任务'}}</text></view><view class="card danger-card"><view class="row"><view><text class="danger-title">注销账号</text><text class="subtitle">将删除账号及关联私人数据，无法恢复。</text></view><button class="danger small" bindtap="deleteAccount">注销账号</button></view></view><text class="privacy-link">隐私说明 ›</text><text class="foot">AI 发送前预览，结果由你确认保存。</text></block></view>
